{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forging System<br>Craft powerful gear with forging stones from level drops. Chance to create Perfect quality gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/\u953b\u9020.png?t=1755825984\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear<br>Gear tiers: Inferior, Common, Fine, Flawless, Perfect. Some Perfect gear has skills like Shield, Firewall, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/f1ffecc05959e680193a8032126b311b.poster.avif?t=1755825984\" width=800 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/f1ffecc05959e680193a8032126b311b.webm?t=1755825984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/f1ffecc05959e680193a8032126b311b.mp4?t=1755825984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artifact Collection<br>Collect Divine Relics from bosses and elites for extra stats beyond your skills and attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/d63fc800c73e2a31d6e64f6895073366.poster.avif?t=1755825984\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/d63fc800c73e2a31d6e64f6895073366.webm?t=1755825984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/d63fc800c73e2a31d6e64f6895073366.mp4?t=1755825984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gacha System<br>Chests drop randomly in levels. Open them for in-game resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/22d88c0d4484c1f7ac6f2f0421abfcca.poster.avif?t=1755825984\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/22d88c0d4484c1f7ac6f2f0421abfcca.webm?t=1755825984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/22d88c0d4484c1f7ac6f2f0421abfcca.mp4?t=1755825984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rune System<br>Enhance gear with runes to boost core stats like Attack and Defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/dbe89da6ae970f83f7229cdfe071491f.poster.avif?t=1755825984\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/dbe89da6ae970f83f7229cdfe071491f.webm?t=1755825984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/dbe89da6ae970f83f7229cdfe071491f.mp4?t=1755825984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards<br>Gain cards by defeating enemies and leveling up. Types: Attribute Cards, Skill Cards, Item Cards. Effects last only this run.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/db6d4183054dd8e74e5bec5bb8d42936.poster.avif?t=1755825984\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/db6d4183054dd8e74e5bec5bb8d42936.webm?t=1755825984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/db6d4183054dd8e74e5bec5bb8d42936.mp4?t=1755825984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses<br>Each level has two bosses: a mini-boss and a main boss. Mini-boss attacks are easier to dodge; main bosses have wider range and high damage. Stay alert!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/6ce5d1eead2972eed51bbffa97ec064e.poster.avif?t=1755825984\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/6ce5d1eead2972eed51bbffa97ec064e.webm?t=1755825984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/6ce5d1eead2972eed51bbffa97ec064e.mp4?t=1755825984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps<br>Five difficulties, each with six unique levels (30 maps total). Clear Difficulty 1 to unlock Endless Mode. Four special challenges offer extra rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/6b8d8b5cfd8354cfa6c3fc5d15e095cf.poster.avif?t=1755825984\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/6b8d8b5cfd8354cfa6c3fc5d15e095cf.webm?t=1755825984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624520/extras/6b8d8b5cfd8354cfa6c3fc5d15e095cf.mp4?t=1755825984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Realm